desc: Delete the line containing 'delete'
category: search
par: 10
hint1: Search jumps the cursor straight to a match
hint2: / searches forward; once there, delete the whole line
solution: /delete<CR>dd
note: /delete<CR> searches for the word and jumps the cursor to it; dd deletes that line.
--- START ---
keep
delete me
keep
--- GOAL ---
keep
keep
--- END ---
